"des rochers ici, non?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgVaultWelcomeToVaultTheTownAt"
msgid "04612"
msgstr ""
"Bienvenue à Vault,\n"
"ville du coeur\n"
"d'Angara."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgVaultWasntEruptionMtAlephIncredible"
msgid "04613"
msgstr ""
"L'éruption du Mont\n"
