"parfait! Quelle chance!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgVaultOkMisterLetMeSee"
msgid "04647"
msgstr ""
"OK, m'sieu...\n"
"Voyons voir ce rocher!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgVaultMyNeighborCreepsMeOutHe"
msgid "04648"
msgstr ""
"Mon voisin me fait peur!{page_break}"
