"attitude pleine de\n"
"suffisance."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgVaultMisterFunSeeStrangeNew"
msgid "04649"
msgstr ""
"Hé, m'sieu!\n"
"C'est sympa de voir\n"
