"Génial, non?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgVaultTicklesBeingTickledByBoy"
msgid "04702"
msgstr ""
"Hé! Ca chatouille...\n"
"Se faire chatouiller par\n"
"un garçon, c'est bof!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgVaultMaybeTheyllFindOurStolenFamily"
