"s'approprier tous les{page_break}"
"gains de Kalay."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLunpaZZZZ"
msgid "09263"
msgstr "Z-z-z-z... Z-z-z-z..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLunpaFatherSorryDodonpa"
msgid "09264"
msgstr ""
"Père... Je suis désolé\n"
