"Allons-y!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09391"
msgstr ""
"La prochaine fois que\n"
"vous rencontrerez\n"
"Dodonpa, il aura changé."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09392"
msgstr ""
"J'ai compris la leçon!\n"
"Je ne ferai plus le\n"
"mal! Laissez-moi partir!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLunpaGaretRefusesToReturn"
msgid "09393"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}! Ne fais pas\n"
"l'idiot!{page_break}"
"Nous ne pouvons\n"
"pas entrer ici!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerAReopened"
msgid "09394"
msgstr ""
"Une bonne partie des\n"
"hommes de Dodonpa a\n"
"quitté la forteresse."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillagerBShivers"
msgid "09395"
