"rien!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsInnWorkerReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09447"
msgstr ""
"Avec le village fermé,\n"
"je me demande s'ils\n"
"viendront."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsChefReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09448"
msgstr ""
"J'ai appris que Donpa\n"
"était malade, mais il me\n"
"semble en forme."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLunpaTemplePriestReopened"
msgid "09449"
msgstr ""
"Quelques hommes de\n"
"Dodonpa ont quitté\n"
"le village il y a{page_break}"
"un bon moment. Je me demande\n"
"quelles horreurs ils\n"
"vont commettre."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsTemplePriestReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09450"
msgstr ""
"Frappez les hommes de\n"
"Dodonpa avec un puissant\n"
